<title>SOUTH AFRICA: FOREIGNERS SELL 129 MLN RAND S.AFRICAN BONDS TUES.</title>
<headline>FOREIGNERS SELL 129 MLN RAND S.AFRICAN BONDS TUES.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Foreigners sold a net 129.05 million rand's worth of South African bonds on Tuesday after buying 839.48 million rand's worth on Monday, the Bond Exchange said.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482-1003</p>
